- [x] Fix the bug that doesn't resolve dependencies from the IR to the Fork / Join.
  - [x] Resolve dependencies
  - [x] Distinguish between Fork and Goto in the final section for every `parallel`.
  - [x] Find the bug that makes the `Node::Join` appears 2 times when it joins N branches.

- [x] Fix the bug that shows $s0,[s1,s2#{s1}]$ as `s2` has an explicit dependency on `s1` so it adds a join, but `s1` is already in the list.
- [ ] Fix the bug that doesn't make Ls5 expands correctly on complex.fk
- [ ] Fix the dependency resolution for parbegin/parend to IR.

- [ ] Refactor everything to use `&str` instead of `String`, because actually there are a lot of clones that can be avoided if we just use `&str` and make sure the lifetimes are correct. This will also make the code more efficient and cleaner.
  - [ ] In case we can't use `&str`, maybe using `Cow<str>` can be a good alternative to avoid unnecessary clones while still allowing for owned strings when needed.
